	(gr_text "4 LAYER FR-4 PCB  as follows\nTop Signal\nInner1 Ground\nInner2 +5V\nBottom Signal\n\nHeaders/USB-C must be as placed.\n\nUSB-C, \nRoute D+/D- to USB 2.0 Standard\n\nParts using JLCPCB Part Numbers\nPower Traces for 12Vin/Raw and vBUS must handle 500mA \n\nAvoid a double sided load if possible\n"
		(locked yes)
